IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TEDDY_BEAR-BEAR-SSA.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-DEFAULT-ENDOWMENT PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-PARTICIPANT-DNA.
   05 D1-DNA-SEED          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-AREA-CODE         PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-SIMULATED-ENDOW   PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-REGIONAL-ISSUANCE.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-SHADOW-SEED       PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D0-DEFAULT-ENDOWMENT.
    MOVE 43605 TO D1-DNA-SEED.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D1-SIMULATED-ENDOW.

    PERFORM STAGE-SSA-ISSUANCE.
    PERFORM EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D2-SHADOW-SEED == D1-DNA-SEED AND D1-SIMULATED-ENDOW == D0-DEFAULT-ENDOWMENT
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 5 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-SSA-ISSUANCE.
    MOVE D1-DNA-SEED TO D2-SHADOW-SEED.
    COMPUTE D1-AREA-CODE = (D1-DNA-SEED - ((D1-DNA-SEED / 9) * 9)) + 1.
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 875 + ((125 * D1-AREA-CODE) / 9).
    EXIT.

EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = (((D1-SIMULATED-ENDOW + (D1-AREA-CODE * 10000)) * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 1000).
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
